<title>UK: Slovakian city Kosice eyes Eurobond market - bankers.</title>
<headline>Slovakian city Kosice eyes Eurobond market - bankers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovakian city of Kosice plans to tap  the international Eurobond market for the first time, bankers said  on Friday.</p>
<p>Kosice had mandated Credit Suisse First Boston to underwrite its debut  financing, syndicate managers said. The city was expected to raise  between $50 and $100 million, they said. -- Aline van Duyn, London  Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
